Package: jotawm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: x-window-manager
Description: minimal tiling window manager for X11
 jotawm is a minimal tiling window manager for X11, arranging
 windows in a binary-tree tiling layout with floating, stage
 manager, and 2D canvas modes, plus workspace support.
 .
 This package also installs jotawm-session, a session launcher
 for use from ~/.xinitrc or a display manager, along with an
 X11 session desktop entry.
